// ==== CARGO TABLE ====
/*

Cargos use a CARGO_INDEX definition so that I can keep the data centralized
Note that cargos from ECS and various other old NewGRFs need to reuse/inherit old indices
for compatibility (but this is only kept for stuff which are consumed by houses pmuch).

*/

// dynamic indices

